codex
The failure is caused by this audit sandbox’s PID namespace: Lean 4.22 resolves its executable via `/proc/<getpid()>/exe`, while the mounted `/proc` exposes the outer PID; `/proc/self/exe` is correct. I’m applying a narrowly scoped local preload shim that redirects only `/proc/<digits>/exe` reads to `/proc/self/exe`, then rerunning the unchanged trusted checker. This does not modify any frozen or generated input.
apply patch
patch: completed
/audit-output/evidence/proc_self_exe_shim.c
