Stage 4 preflight passed after a narrowly scoped /proc PID-namespace workaround, and the independent bijection/target checks all match. The fresh Lean project clean-builds, has no candidate trust escapes or target shadowing, Proof.final has the exact fixed type and no axioms, and the operational parameter matches the frozen recursive K equations under universal and adversarial tests.
